      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know if i'm just overthinking it but i've been seeing these specific numbers everywhere today and it's starting to feel weird. like i can't shake the feeling they mean something.\n\n11:11 (checked my phone)\n4.44 (receipt for my coffee)\n9 (cars that passed while i was waiting for the bus)\n22 (the exit number on the highway)\n\ncan u look at these and see if there's a link or a pattern i'm missing?? it feels like a sequence.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
